<h1 class='doclevel'>1.Test Suite : svir3633_WBT</h1>
<div><p>Suita de teste white-box pentru metoda computeTotal din OrderService</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc30865"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-64: svir3633_WBT_TC01&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">svir3633</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se verifica faptul ca metoda computeTotal returneaza totalul curent (40.0) pentru o comanda cu 2 produse valide: Apa (pret=12.0, qty=1) si Gutui (pret=14.0, qty=2)</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>Produsele Apa si Gutui sunt salvate in productRepo</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Se creeaza Order cu OrderItem(Apa, 1) si OrderItem(Gutui, 2). Se apeleaza computeTotal(order).</p>
</td><td><p>Returneaza 40.0</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">svir3633_F02:  Testare White-Box, Test Coverage [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc30869"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-65: svir3633_WBT_TC02&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">svir3633</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se verifica faptul ca metoda computeTotal arunca RuntimeException cu mesajul &quot;Order has unknown items&quot; cand comanda contine un produs care nu exista in productRepo.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>productRepo este gol (produsul nu este salvat).</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Se creaza Order cu OrderItem(produs necunoscut, qty=1). Se apeleaza computeTotal(order).</p>
</td><td><p>Se arunca RuntimeException(&quot;Order has unknown items).</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
